# ── Chapter 10 fidelity pins: "What Money Cannot Buy" ───────────────────────
#
# KIND: CONTENT pin. Run:
#   ./verify.sh --only book-1/10-what-money-cannot-buy.pins.nibli
#   ./verify.sh          # all substantive pins and contradiction checks
#
# The chapter's case lists tests/pins/records/child_with_nobody/fixture.nibli.
# Harrow, the one probe witness below, is fresh; every record it attests is a
# fresh constant too, so nothing here completes a finding about anybody.
#
# The families this chapter renders carry their own executable coverage:
#   book-1/source/economic-constitution.pins.nibli     every barrier, with its
#       unregistered-handle negative beside each
#   book-1/source/public-scale-vocabulary.pins.nibli   the closed vocabularies
#   book-1/source/economic-power-062.pins.nibli .. 088  each public power: the
#       acquisition (062), knowledge access (063), the private-power finding
#       (064) and its remedies (065-071), taxation, appropriation, spending,
#       guarantee, borrowing (072-076), the monetary office (077), credit (078),
#       tax collection (085), unit of account, backbone, complements (086-088)
#   book-1/source/counterfactual/no-economic-direct-effects.pins.nibli
#   book-1/source/counterfactual/no-economic-data-wall.pins.nibli
#   book-1/source/counterfactual/no-economic-independent-current-review-062.pins.nibli
#       .. -088: each power losing its current review, one at a time
#   book-1/source/counterfactual/no-economic-carry-results.pins.nibli
#   book-1/source/counterfactual/no-public-scale-trigger-vocabulary.pins.nibli
#   book-1/source/counterfactual/unnamed-public-scale-trigger.pins.nibli
#
# WHAT FALSE MEANS HERE: a FALSE is pinned only where the KB could have said
# TRUE, and the comment says what would flip it.

:expect-pins 76

# "no form of provision is privileged" and "ability to pay cannot decide access"
? prevents(Adam, EconomicFormSuppression).
# => TRUE

? prevents(Adam, OwnershipFormImmunity).
# => TRUE

? prevents(Adam, OwnershipFormGuaranteedMarketShare).
# => TRUE

? prevents(Adam, OwnershipFormGuaranteedProfit).
# => TRUE

? prevents(Adam, OwnershipFormGuaranteedBailout).
# => TRUE

? prevents(Adam, OwnershipFormGuaranteedMonopoly).
# => TRUE

? prevents(Adam, EconomicFactorFloorGate).
# => TRUE

? prevents(Adam, PaymentInstrumentAsDelivery).
# => TRUE

